  "briefing": "Meridian Combine holds Mongolia through its container park. Reconnect 2 relays, download the records from the vault server, unlock the service gate, then leave by the exit. Expect 12 enemy agents and 5 guards on the streets.",
  "story": "Mongolia Audit: Meridian Combine runs Mongolia from its container park, and the district only notices when the lights go out. Your team has one night to reconnect the relays, download the records and walk out the exit.",
  "debrief": {
    "success": "Mongolia wakes up with the container park in other hands. Your team is back in the dark before morning.",
    "failure": "The team is down in Mongolia before the work was done. Regroup and try a different approach."
  },
